{{also|Morgen}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|nl|morgen||measure of land}}, or alternatively from Low German ''morgen''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|historical}} a unit of measurement of land in the [[Netherlands]] and the Dutch colonies, also used in [[Prussia]], [[Denmark]] and [[Norway]], equivalent to 8,000 square metres, or two [[acre]]s.

